# Build output for the player web app.
player/dist/

# .env holds only the Supabase URL and publishable key. Those are designed to
# ship inside client apps — every table is behind row level security, so the
# key alone grants nothing. Anything genuinely secret (the Discord client
# secret, OAuth tokens) is stored in the OS keystore under the app's userData
# directory and never touches this repo.
#
# Local overrides, which may contain anything, stay out.
.env.local
.env.*.local

